Fourth Upgrades Dwellings	0	0	1	-1	0	0	300	Fourth Upgrades Dwellings	Fourth upgraded level 7 monsters may be recuited in towns if the fourth upgrade buildings have been built.	FOURTH UPGRADES DWELLINGS

Option 300

Fourth upgraded level 7 monsters may be recuited in towns if the third upgrade buildings have been built.

If this option isn't selected, fourth upgrades may only be obtained via Hill Forts or level 8 dwellings on the map.

List of Fourth Upgrades
--------------------------------
Supreme Archangel --> Cherub
Diamond Dragon --> Brilliant Diamond Dragon
Lord of Thunder --> Guardian of Thunder
Hell Baron --> Antichrist
Blood Dragon --> Red Bones Dragon
Darkness Dragon --> Chasm Dragon
Ghost Behemoth --> Ancestral Behemoth
Hell Hydra --> Nightmare Hydra
Sacred Phoenix --> Divine Phoenix	
Eighth Monsters Dwellings	0	0	1	-1	1	1	301	Eighth Monsters Dwellings	Every town now has a eighth dwelling, where you may recruite extra tier monsters .	EIGHTH MONSTERS DWELLINGS

Option 301

Every town now has a eighth dwelling, where you may recruit extra tier monsters.

If this option is disabled, neither the player nor the computer will be able to recruit these monsters in towns.

