--------------------------------
Castle: Templar --> Paladin
Rampart: Forest Spirit --> Spring Spirit
Tower: Drake Golem --> Dragon Golem
Inferno: Tartarus Fiend --> Ahriman
Necropolis: Dark Templar --> Dark Paladin
Dungeon: Lady Spider --> Queen Spider
Stonghold: Coatl --> Quetzalcoatl
Fortress: Sea Serpent --> Leviathan
Conflux: Planeswalker --> Elementalist	
